<title>USA: Bay Meadows/California Jockey sees Q4 hurt.</title>
<headline>Bay Meadows/California Jockey sees Q4 hurt.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Meadows Operating Co and California Jockey Club said Friday that fourth quarter 1996 will be hurt by having 24 fewer days of live racing than the period in 1995.</p>
<p>Bay Meadows and California Jockey are awaiting shareholder approval of their binding acquisition with Patriot American Hospitality Inc.</p>
<p>On Friday the pair reported third quarter losses of $0.11 per share, compared to $0.19 per share in the 1995 third quarter.</p>
</text>
